CM_ "BMW i3 SBOX (PN 61278648904) private Local-CAN at 500 kbit/s. Not the PHEV SBox 0x100/0x300 protocol. Contactors are GPIO, not CAN. Version 0.1 - 2026-09-26.";
CM_ BU_ SBOX "Pack-internal safety / contactor box. Emits measurement frames with only +12V on pins 7/8.";
CM_ BU_ SME "Speicher Management Elektronik. Optional. Not required to read HV.";
CM_ BU_ ZombieVerter "Intended VCU listener.";

CM_ BO_ 256 "Pack / battery-side voltage. Three 0-30 V ramps on battery posts peaked 31552 mV. Stays ~0.1 V when PSU is on the output posts. Map to Zombie udc2.";
CM_ BO_ 272 "Vehicle / output-side voltage. Follows output-side PSU ramps. Peaked ~17.5 V on every 30 V output sweep so far - scale or sense point still to confirm. Map to Zombie udc.";
CM_ BO_ 288 "Tracks output-side voltage on V sweeps. Not traction current. Do not map to idc. Scale unconfirmed - raw signed values only.";
CM_ BO_ 304 "Pack current through the shunt. 1 count = 1 mA. Use only when Current_Flags == 0x00. Current_Flags == 0x80 is a sentinel (~every 10th frame) - discard analog. Battery-side 10 A -> +10447. Car-side 10 A -> -10305. Map to Zombie idc.";
CM_ BO_ 80 "Almost always 40 54 FF FF DF FF. Period matches the 0x130 sentinel cadence.";
CM_ BO_ 320 "After wake: 01 00 FF FF plus alive/CRC. Looks like alive / measurement-valid.";
CM_ BO_ 368 "Typically 00 00 00 xx 50 81 05 plus CRC.";
CM_ BO_ 309 "B0 ticks by 1 per second (session timer).";
CM_ BO_ 528 "Static 75 69 00 05 06 5F 01 03 in every log so far.";
CM_ BO_ 336 "SME only. Constant FD F4 40 A7 in the captured logs.";
CM_ BO_ 352 "SME only. Constant 00 00 00 0E in the captured logs.";

CM_ SG_ 256 Pack_V "u16le(B0,B1) / 1000. Zombie: udc2.";
CM_ SG_ 272 Output_V "u16le(B0,B1) / 1000. Zombie: udc. Confirm against a meter; 17.5 V cap seen on bench.";
CM_ SG_ 304 Pack_Current "i16le(B0,B1) / 1000 amps. IGNORE this signal when Current_Flags == 0x80.";
CM_ SG_ 304 Current_Flags "0x00 = analog valid. 0x80 = sentinel, discard current.";
CM_ SG_ 256 Pack_Alive "B4 high nibble, 0-F wrap.";
CM_ SG_ 272 Output_Alive "B4 high nibble, 0-F wrap.";
CM_ SG_ 288 Companion_Alive "B4 high nibble, 0-F wrap.";
CM_ SG_ 304 Current_Alive "B4 high nibble, 0-F wrap.";
CM_ SG_ 309 SessionTimer_s "Increments by 1 each second after wake.";

VAL_ 304 Current_Flags 0 "Valid" 128 "Sentinel_discard";
VAL_ 256 Pack_Flags 0 "Valid";
VAL_ 272 Output_Flags 0 "Valid";
VAL_ 288 Companion_Flags 0 "Valid";
